t>かろう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でくたくたになっていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">She was worn out from overwork.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">辛うじて</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かろうじて</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">勉强；勉勉强强；好不容易；费力地</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"170240\"><ruby>際<rp>(</rp><rt>きわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>どいところを<ruby>辛<rp>(</rp><rt>かろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>うじて<ruby>助<rp>(</rp><rt>たす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I had a close shave.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">交わす</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かわす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">交换（信息、问候、争论等）；相交；交叉；交织；互相…；彼此…</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"166653\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たちはあいさつを<ruby>交<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>わし<ruby>合<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">We exchanged greetings.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">代わる代わる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かわるがわる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">轮流；交替；依次</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"123077\"><ruby>二人<rp>(</rp><rt>ふたり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はかわるがわる<ruby>試<rp>(</rp><rt>こころ</rt><rp>)</rp></r