183838\"><ruby>簡潔<rp>(</rp><rt>かんけつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>機知<rp>(</rp><rt>きち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>精髄<rp>(</rp><rt>せいずい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Brevity is the soul of wit.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">還元</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんげん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\">回馈；还原</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n1/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">還</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\" data-id=\"n1:v:還元する\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">還元する</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんげんする</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅲ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅲ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">回馈；还原</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>利益<rp>(</rp><rt>りえき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>社会<rp>(</rp><rt>しゃかい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>還元<rp>(</rp><rt>かんげん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\">把利益回馈社会。</span></div><span class=\"st\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li>"]